+
+v0.9.5 - 2018-06-23
+  - Fix some warnings.
+
+v0.9.4 - 2018-06-14
+  - Optimizations to seeking.
+  - Clean up.
+
+v0.9.3 - 2018-05-22
+  - Bug fix.
+
+v0.9.2 - 2018-05-12
